---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: ""
description: "Do you own your music and want to play it anywhere? Cueport builds a library from Serato or a music folder, syncs your phone over your local network, and lets you add cues and edit sets on either device."
homeMain: true
---

<section class="home-hero">
  <div class="container home-hero-inner">
    <div class="home-copy">
      <p class="home-eyebrow">A local-first phone + desktop app</p>
      <h2 class="home-title">{{ site.subtitle }}.</h2>
      <div class="home-intro">
        <p class="home-sub"><strong class="home-question-inline">{{ site.homeQuestion }}</strong> {{ site.homeDescription }}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="home-actions">
        <a class="app-btn app-btn--primary" href="{{ site.downloads.mac }}" aria-label="Request Cueport access">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M17.05 20.28c-.98.95-2.05.8-3.08.35-1.09-.46-2.09-.48-3.24 0-1.44.62-2.2.44-3.06-.35C2.79 15.25 3.51 7.59 9.05 7.31c1.35.07 2.29.74 3.08.74.85 0 2.39-.91 4.01-.78 1.51.13 2.65.72 3.4 1.8-3.12 1.87-2.38 5.98.48 7.13-.57 1.5-1.31 2.99-2.9 4.08M12.03 7.25c-.15-2.23 1.66-4.07 3.74-4.25.29 2.58-2.34 4.5-3.74 4.25"/>
          </svg>
          <span class="app-btn-text">Download Cueport</span>
        </a>
        <a class="app-btn app-btn--secondary" href="{{ site.demo.url }}" aria-label="{{ site.demo.label }}">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M7 4l13 8-13 8z"/>
          </svg>
          <span class="app-btn-text"><span class="demo-label-full">{{ site.demo.label }}</span><span class="demo-label-short">Demo</span></span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="home-art" aria-hidden="true">
      <img src="/assets/img/logo-transparent.svg" width="280" height="280" alt="" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
